Datasets and results between your laptop and the P1 clusters. Code goes with git, cloned on
the login node. Data goes through the login node, and a stopped copy picks up where it left off. The air-gapped P1 NGC HPC takes files only through its staging area, as its
[provider page](/providers/ngc/) describes.

## With aicentre

```bash
aicentre push datasets       # datasets/ into your project directory on the cluster
aicentre pull results        # results/ back to this folder
```

- `push` and `pull` use the same login as every other aicentre command, so a provider that asks
  for a password asks once.
- Paths on the cluster start in your project directory, `/dtu/p1/<username>` on DTU and your
  home directory on Gefion. `-p gefion` picks another provider than the first you use.
